# Abacus AI's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-abacus-setting-cookie = 登录 https://apps.abacus.ai，打开“开发者工具 > 应用 > Cookie”，选择 https://apps.abacus.ai，并复制会话 Cookie（名称包含“session”、“auth”或“sid”）。以“name=value; name2=value2”格式粘贴；也可复制任意 apps.abacus.ai 请求的完整 Cookie 请求头。

## The report: the organization's compute credits this billing cycle.

# The limit's name.
usage-abacus-credits = 点数
# The balance: credits used out of the cycle's total.
usage-abacus-credits-used = 已用点数
